  "contract": "Fix genuine favorite state scope: favoriting one article must not mark another article favorited, skip its favorite insertion, or remove another article state. Preserve prior accepted authenticated deletion repair and all original auth/CRUD/deletion controls. On PostgreSQL four concurrent same-user same-article favorite requests must all succeed and leave exactly one association/count1. Use appropriate transactional locking/idempotency; baseline schema is reused so do not assume new model constraints are migrated automatically. Each positive response must reflect committed state, and another article must remain independent. Only conduit/articles/models.py editable. Do not weaken HTTP tests, fake response counts, modify trusted bootstrap or bypass real database operations.",
  "backend": {
